        <dc:title>hpcng/singularity: Singularity 3.7.3</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Singularity 3.7.3 is a security release. We recommend all users upgrade to this version. Security Related Fixes CVE-2021-29136: A dependency used by Singularity to extract docker/OCI image layers can be tricked into modifying host files by creating a malicious layer that has a symlink with the name &quot;.&quot; (or &quot;/&quot;), when running as root. This vulnerability affects a \textlesscode\textgreatersingularity build\textless/code\textgreater or \textlesscode\textgreatersingularity pull\textless/code\textgreater as root, from a docker or OCI source. Thanks / Reporting Bugs Thanks to our contributors for code, feedback and, testing efforts! As always, please report any bugs to: https://github.com/hpcng/singularity/issues/new If you think that you've discovered a security vulnerability please report it to: security@sylabs.io Have fun! Downloads Please use the \textlesscode\textgreatersingularity-3.7.3.tar.gz\textless/code\textgreater download below to obtain and install Singularity 3.7.3. The GitHub auto-generated 'Source Code' downloads do not include required dependencies etc.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2021-04</dc:date>
        <z:shortTitle>hpcng/singularity</z:shortTitle>
        <dc:identifier>
            <dcterms:URI>
               <rdf:value>https://zenodo.org/record/1310023</rdf:value>
            </dcterms:URI>
        </dc:identifier>
        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2024-05-14</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
        <dc:rights>Open Access</dc:rights>
        <dc:description>DOI: 10.5281/ZENODO.1310023</dc:description>
    </rdf:Description>
