        <dc:title>Pest Genomics Initiative - Chironomus riparius</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Profile
Species: Chironomus riparius (Meigen) a.k.a. C. thummi - Harlequin fly
Order: Diptera
Family: Chironomidae
Genus: Chironomus
C. riparius, also known as C. thummi and commonly known as the harlequin fly, is a species of non-biting midge. The larvae are known by the common name of blood worm</dcterms:abstract>
