        <dc:title>Reproducibility and Transparency by Design *</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>The reproducibility of bioinformatics analyses can be elevated to equal status with
biological discovery. To achieve this, reproducibility must become part of the process,
not an afterthought.</dcterms:abstract>
