        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_281"/>
        <prism:edition>v1.4.1</prism:edition>
        <dc:title>AGAT: Another Gff Analysis Toolkit to handle annotations in any GTF/GFF format.</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>What's Changed



Allow agat_sp_filter_feature_by_attribute_value to filter with multiple values - fix #426 by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/464

Add possibility to output agat_sp_statistics.pl result in yaml format - fix #401 by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/466

fix #420. Now table 0 can be called (bioperl &gt;= april 2024 must be pr… by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/470

Fix #471 - agat_sp_filter_feature_by_attribute_value.pl  to allow the use of &quot;!&quot; test by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/473

Fix #475 : Added an option for agat_sp_merge_annotations.pl to refer a folder of GFF files by @IvanUgrin in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/476

Mfannot - agat_convert_mfannot2gff.pl - big improvement in handling this conversion by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/483

sort tag L2 for better reproducibility in a function of  OmniscientO by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/487

fix #484 by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/488 - CDS must not be attached to Level2 if no Parent/ID relationship and locus name not the same as previous L2. Should be parsed using locus instead of sequential (as expected).

fix #307 - Update agat_sp_statistics.pl to provide median and percentile statistics by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/489

remove transcript ID in Level1 feature when creating it from another feature used as template (clean_clone) by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/491


Documentation:



Update documentation  of agat_convert_minimap2_bam2gff.md by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/452

Update README - Update Zenodo to always point to latest DOI

rename agat_sp_fix_cds_frame.pl to agat_sp_fix_cds_phase.pl  in pod of the script and its corresponding md doc file

fix mispelling script name in doc. fix #456 by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/465

remove unused inflate option from agat_convert_genscan2gff.pl and agat_convert_genscan2gff.md fix #477 by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/481

update doc agat_sp_compare_two_annotations.pl  by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/490

Shift AGAT documentation from readthedocs to Mkdocs (gh-pages of GitHub now)  by @Juke34 in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/482


New Contributors



@IvanUgrin made their first contribution in https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/pull/476 (fix #475)


Full Changelog: https://github.com/NBISweden/AGAT/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1</dcterms:abstract>
